unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"erfei-q-11e7ade3e266058d330a","section":"chapter-034","block":"b-b00e4a0b53c2891dee6b","layer":"original","quote":"建兴十五年，入为贵人","section_title":"二主妃子传第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0074.xhtml","index":53,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":14,"end":24,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"erfei-q-166daf5a6497ce05eb80","section":"chapter-034","block":"b-559929cbb11346eb3c9d","layer":"original","quote":"咸熙元年，东迁洛阳","section_title":"二主妃子传第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0074.xhtml","index":82,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":53,"end":62,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"erfei-q-2ac67891597232b60d94","section":"chapter-034","block":"b-c3038fb75598428ebec4","layer":"modern","quote":"〖1〗十五年：建兴十五年（公元 237）。","attribution":"现代注释","section_title":"二主妃子传第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0074.xhtml","index":51,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-c270638c18397ec944ad","start":0,"end":21,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"erfei-q-59a05dba4e92324ca1bc","section":"chapter-034","block":"b-c938dd06ea7b294157c0","layer":"original","quote":"咸熙元年，随后主迁于洛阳","section_title":"二主妃子传第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0074.xhtml","index":54,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":12,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"erfei-q-9b6489ed64b925f8beb5","section":"chapter-034","block":"b-4eab094a726e8ab41bd6","layer":"original","quote":"咸熙元年，永东迁洛阳","section_title":"二主妃子传第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0074.xhtml","index":63,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":10,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"erfei-q-a439f0801272a0726186","section":"chapter-034","block":"b-b00e4a0b53c2891dee6b","layer":"original","quote":"延熙元年春正月，策曰","section_title":"二主妃子传第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0074.xhtml","index":53,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":25,"end":35,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"erfei-q2-b6c16f582166fd9ee0c7","section":"chapter-034","block":"b-b00e4a0b53c2891dee6b","layer":"original","quote":"后主张皇后，前后敬哀之妹也。建兴十五年，入为贵人。延熙元年春正月，策曰：“朕统承大业，君临天下，奉郊庙、社稷。今以贵人为皇后。使行丞相事、左将军（向）朗〖1〗，持节，授玺绶。勉修中馈〖2〗，恪肃禋祀〖3〗。皇后其敬之哉！”","section_title":"二主妃子传第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0074.xhtml","index":53,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":111,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"houzhu-q-O084","section":"chapter-033","block":"b-69369361a27c892bfdc4","layer":"original","quote":"后主举家东迁；既至洛阳，策命之曰：“惟景元五年三月丁亥〖1〗，皇帝临轩〖2〗，使太常嘉命刘禅为安乐县公〖3〗。於戏〖4〗，其进听朕命！盖统天载物，以咸宁为大〖5〗；光宅天下〖6〗，以时雍为盛〖7〗。故孕育群生者，君人之道也〖8〗；乃顺承天者〖9〗，坤元之义也〖10〗。上下交畅，然后万物协和，庶类获乂〖11〗。乃者汉氏失统〖12〗，六合震扰。我太祖承运龙兴，弘济八极〖13〗；是用应天顺民〖14〗，抚有区夏〖15〗。于时乃考因群杰虎争〖16〗，九服不静〖17〗，乘间阻远〖18〗，保据庸蜀〖19〗；遂使西隅殊封〖20〗，方外壅隔〖21〗。自是以来，干戈不戢〖22〗；元元之民，不得保安其性〖23〗，几将五纪〖24〗。朕永惟祖考遗志〖25〗，思在绥缉四海〖26〗，率土同轨；故爰整六师〖27〗，耀威梁、益〖28〗。公恢崇德度〖29〗，深秉大正；不惮屈身委质〖30〗，以爱民全国为贵〖31〗；降心回虑〖32〗，应机豹变〖33〗；履信思顺，以享左右无疆之休〖34〗。岂不远欤〖35〗！朕嘉与君公长飨显禄〖36〗，用考咨前训〖37〗，开国胙土〖38〗，率遵旧典，锡兹玄土〖39〗，苴以白茅〖40〗；永为魏藩辅。往钦哉〖41〗！公其祗服朕命〖42〗，克广德心，以终乃显烈〖43〗。”","section_title":"后主传第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0072.xhtml","index":207,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":536,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
